olicy"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Macros","title":"Macros","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Slice()","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Swidux()"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddleware","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/UndoMiddleware"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/FlushOutcome"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Foundation"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"Swidux-logo","type":"image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux is a Redux-style state-management library for SwiftUI. State lives in one observable store, mutations go through reducers, and side effects run as async effects. Macros generate the observability boilerplate. Built-in plugins handle persistence and undo\/redo. Optional plugins ship ready-made paywalls (RevenueCat or StoreKit-shaped), version killswitches, parental gates, analytics (Mixpanel or any backend), feature flags, and SwiftData\/iCloud persistence.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The dispatch cycle:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["View → store.send(.action)","  → willReduce hooks (UndoPlugin snapshots here)","  → reducer mutates state in place, optionally returns Effect","  → plugin reducers handle their own actions","  → afterReduce hooks (PersistencePlugin drains EntityStore changelogs here)","  → observer tree updates only changed properties (per-property observation)","  → effects run on a background actor; results dispatch back via @MainActor send"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text